---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy: Onions Without Tears" description="Privacy policy for onionswithouttears.co.uk.">

  <section class="bg-white flex-1">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-20">

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-center text-text-muted mb-12">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-text-muted">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Who we are</h2>
          <p>This website (onionswithouttears.co.uk) is the personal book promotion site for <em>Onions Without Tears</em> by Alison Bessborough. It is not a commercial business.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">What data we collect</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">When you visit any page, we record a lightweight visit log containing:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-outside pl-6 space-y-1 mb-3">
            <li>Your IP address</li>
            <li>Your approximate location (city, region, country and timezone), inferred from your IP by our hosting provider Cloudflare</li>
            <li>The page you visited and the referring URL (if any)</li>
            <li>Your browser's user-agent string (used only to identify the general device type, e.g. iPhone, Android, Windows)</li>
            <li>A timestamp of the visit</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mb-3">This data is stored in Cloudflare's key-value storage and is <strong>automatically deleted after 30 days</strong>. It is visible only to the site owner via a password-protected page, and is used to gauge interest in the book. No advertising or profiling is done with it and it is never shared with third parties.</p>
          <p class="mb-3">Aggregate, non-personal usage statistics are also collected by <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/en-gb/web-analytics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-onion hover:text-onion-dark underline decoration-onion/40 hover:decoration-onion transition-colors">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>, which does not use cookies or record any personal data.</p>
          <p>If you submit the contact form we also collect your name, email address and message.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Cookies</h2>
          <p>The site does not set any cookies of its own. Your browser may retain small local-storage entries used to remember your preferences on the visitor-log page — these never leave your device.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Legal basis</h2>
          <p>The visit log and aggregate analytics are collected under the "legitimate interest" basis (UK GDPR Art. 6(1)(f)) so we can understand how the site is being used. Contact form data is processed on the basis of your consent, given when you submit the form.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">How your data is used</h2>
          <p>The visit log is used only to see how many people are looking at the site and roughly where they are. Contact form messages are used solely to respond to your enquiry. Nothing is used for marketing, passed to third parties for their own purposes, or added to any mailing list.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Where your data is stored</h2>
          <p>Visit logs and analytics are stored by <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/en-gb/trust-hub/gdpr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-onion hover:text-onion-dark underline decoration-onion/40 hover:decoration-onion transition-colors">Cloudflare</a>, our hosting provider. Contact form submissions are processed and stored by <a href="https://formspree.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-onion hover:text-onion-dark underline decoration-onion/40 hover:decoration-onion transition-colors">Formspree</a>, a third-party service based in the United States. You can read their privacy policy at <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-onion hover:text-onion-dark underline decoration-onion/40 hover:decoration-onion transition-colors">formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Google Maps</h2>
          <p>The Buy Now page includes an optional Google Maps embed. It does not load unless you choose to tap the map. If you do, Google's own privacy policy applies.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Your rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal data we hold about you. To do so, please <a href="/buy-now/" class="text-onion hover:text-onion-dark underline decoration-onion/40 hover:decoration-onion transition-colors">get in touch</a>. You can also complain to the UK's Information Commissioner's Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-onion hover:text-onion-dark underline decoration-onion/40 hover:decoration-onion transition-colors">ico.org.uk</a>.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />

</Layout>
